isonous aphrodisiac effect. The woman in green had a look of horror on her pale face, gasping for breath, and her body was twitching constantly. Hearing the shout, he subconsciously turned his head and saw a black figure in the sky heading straight towards their flower boat... No, it should be said that it was smashing towards their flower boat. However, before she could react, the black figure hit her hard, knocking her away. Her body turned over the railing of the boat and fell into the water. The handsome man's face was flushed, and his handsome face was a bit more terrifying than that of Hell. Kale pollen is extremely poisonous, and the only way to detoxify it is to have sex with a woman. woman? The man's eyes fell on the ship's plank, staring at the black body as if he wanted to tear her into pieces! At the same time, the black body on the ship board moved. It moved slightly, and it hurt. It felt as if the body was shattered by explosives. Every part of her body was screaming, as if it was struggling to escape from her body. She couldn't help but groan when her body moved slightly. Her eyes sank into the rocks. However, before she could open her eyes, a male body was covering her entire body. The smell of a man spread into her nostrils. Lan Ya was shocked. The first thought that came to her mind was that her plan failed and she was imprisoned by the Silver Moon Family! Before her thoughts could fully unfold, hot lips appeared on her mouth and bit her, making her head buzz. Her clothes were roughly torn apart, and the devil's claws scratched scars on her body. The pain was so painful that she almost fainted again, biting the mouth that was on her lips. The man groaned, not affected by this little episode at all. The strength in his hand increased, making the person under him unable to move. The lips bit into each other more wantonly, as if a leopard was trying to tear apart the food it had hunted. Lanya was completely horrified, her lips and whole body hurt as if they were being tortured. She didn't expect that the Yinyue family would treat her like this. Yinyue's information was destroyed, and she was the only one who knew all the secrets of Yinyue's medicines, and they actually abused her. \"Stop...if you want to know all the drug technology and my blood, stop...\" Mou Zujin shouted, with a trace of luck in his heart... She didn't believe that everyone in Yiyue didn't care about the content of the information, and she didn't believe that they would destroy a carefully cultivated drug chess piece. However, her luck and all her disbelief will all come to naught here... The shouting words have no effect at all, and the man shows no sign of stopping. There is a sudden pain in her body, and she feels the male desire under her body. She knows that this disaster cannot be avoided... Tears fall in humiliation... Night has just fallen, and this night is destined to be the longest...", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}